 saat ini adalah %d°.","First Quarter":"Kuartal Satu","Moderate visibility.":"Visibilitas sedang.","NNW":"barat laut","Waning Gibbous":"Separuh Pudar","Waxing Crescent":"Sabit Besar","Poor visibility.":"Visibilitas buruk.","Perfectly clear view.":"Pemandangan yang sangat jelas.","NNE":"TIDAK","Good visibility.":"Visibilitas yang bagus.","New Moon":"Bulan Baru","Very poor visibility.":"Visibilitas sangat buruk.","NW":"barat laut","Excellent visibility.":"Visibilitas luar biasa.","Waning Crescent":"Sabit Pudar","Last Quarter":"Kuartal Akhir","Waxing Gibbous":"Separuh Besar","Full Moon":"Bulan Purnama","WSW":"baratdaya","NE":"TIDAK","Center on location":"Pusatkan pada lokasi","Data sources":"Sumber data","Forecast time":"Waktu prakiraan","Loading wind forecast…":"Memuat prakiraan angin…","Map layers":"Lapisan peta","Now":"Sekarang","Open wind map":"Buka peta angin","Pause":"Jeda","Play":"Putar","Retry":"Coba lagi","The arrows move in the direction the wind travels. The direction label shows where the wind comes from.":"Garis bergerak searah hembusan angin. Label arah menunjukkan dari mana angin berasal.","Wind Map":"Peta Angin","Wind Speed":"Kecepatan Angin","Wind between forecast locations is estimated. Local conditions can differ, especially near mountains and coasts.":"Angin di antara titik prakiraan merupakan perkiraan. Kondisi setempat dapat berbeda, terutama di dekat pegunungan dan pantai.","Wind data unavailable":"Data angin tidak tersedia","Your Locations":"Lokasi Anda","Map Data":"Data Peta","Weather data provided by Apple has been modified to create forecast maps.":"Data cuaca dari Apple telah diolah untuk membuat peta prakiraan.","cardinal.N":"N","cardinal.NNE":"TIDAK","cardinal.NE":"TIDAK","cardinal.ENE":"ENE","cardinal.E":"E","cardinal.ESE":"ESE","cardinal.SE":"SE","cardinal.SSE":"SSE","cardinal.S":"S","cardinal.SSW":"SSW","cardinal.SW":"SW","cardinal.WSW":"baratdaya","cardinal.W":"W","cardinal.WNW":"WNW","cardinal.NW":"barat laut","cardinal.NNW":"barat laut","Temperature":"Suhu","%@'s chance: %d%%":"Peluang %@: %d%%","About Feels Like Temperature":"Tentang suhu yang terasa","About Wind Speed and Gusts":"Tentang Kecepatan dan Hembusan Angin","About the Beaufort Scale":"Tentang Skala Beaufort","The dew point is what the temperature would need to fall to for dew to form. It can be a useful way to tell how humid the air feels — the higher the dew point, the more humid it feels. A dew point that matches the current temperature means the relative humidity is 100%, and there may be dew or fog.":"Titik embun adalah suhu yang harus diturunkan agar embun dapat terbentuk. Ini bisa menjadi cara yang berguna untuk mengetahui seberapa lembap suatu udara — semakin tinggi titik embun, semakin lembap rasanya. Titik embun yang sesuai dengan suhu saat ini berarti kelembapan relatifnya 100%, dan mungkin terdapat embun atau kabut.","About Dew Point":"Tentang Titik Embun","Relative humidity, commonly known just as humidity, is the amount of moisture in the air compared with what the air can hold. The air can hold more moisture at higher temperatures. A relative humidity near 100% means there may be dew or fog.":"Kelembapan relatif, umumnya dikenal sebagai kelembapan, adalah jumlah kelembapan di udara dibandingkan dengan apa yang dapat ditampung udara. Udara dapat menahan lebih banyak kelembapan pada suhu yang lebih tinggi. Kelembapan relatif mendekati 100% berarti mungkin terdapat embun atau kabut.","About Relative Humidity":"Tentang Kelembaban Relatif","Intensity is calculated based on how much rain or snow falls per hour and is meant to indicate how heavy the rain or snow will feel. It is also used with other precipitation types such as sleet and wintry mix. A downpour or heavy snowstorm can have a \"heavy\" intensity, while an average rainfall or lighter drizzle can have a \"moderate\" or \"light\" intensity.":"Intensitas dihitung berdasarkan banyaknya hujan atau salju yang turun per jam dan dimaksudkan untuk menunjukkan seberapa lebat hujan atau salju akan terasa. Ini juga digunakan untuk jenis presipitasi lain seperti hujan es bercampur air dan campuran musim dingin. Hujan deras atau badai salju lebat dapat memiliki intensitas “lebat”, sedangkan hujan biasa atau gerimis yang lebih ringan dapat memiliki intensitas “sedang” atau “ringan”.","About Precipitation Intensity":"Tentang Intensitas Curah Hujan","Significant, rapid changes in pressure are used to predict changes in the weather. For example, a drop in pressure can mean that rain or snow is on the way, and rising pressure can mean that weather will improve. Pressure is also called barometric pressure or atmospheric pressure.":"Perubahan tekanan yang signifikan dan cepat digunakan untuk memprediksi perubahan cuaca. Misalnya, penurunan tekanan dapat berarti akan turun hujan atau salju, dan peningkatan tekanan dapat berarti bahwa cuaca akan membaik. Tekanan disebut juga tekanan barometrik atau tekanan atmosfer.","About Pressure":"Tentang Tekanan","Visibility tells you how far away you can clearly see objects like buildings and hills. It is a measure of the transparency of the air and does not take into account the amount of sunlight or the presence of obstructions. Visibility at or above %@ is considered clear.":"Visibilitas memberi tahu Anda seberapa jauh Anda dapat melihat dengan jelas objek seperti bangunan dan bukit. Ini adalah ukuran transparansi udara dan tidak memperhitungkan jumlah sinar matahari atau adanya penghalang. Jarak pandang pada atau di atas %@ dianggap jelas.","About Visibility":"Tentang Visibilitas","Actual":"Sebenarnya","Calm":"Tenang","Light air":"Udara ringan","Storm":"Badai","Violent storm":"Badai yang dahsyat","Hurricane-force":"Kekuatan badai","Light breeze":"Angin sepoi-sepoi","Gentle breeze":"Angin sepoi-sepoi","Moderate breeze":"Angin sepoi-sepoi","Fresh breeze":"Angin segar","Strong breeze":"Angin kencang","High wind":"Angin kencang","Gale":"angin kencang","Strong gale":"Angin kencang","Description":"Deskripsi","Beaufort Scale":"Skala Beaufort","Chance of Precipitation":"Peluang Curah Hujan","Clear":"Cerah","Foggy":"Berkabut","Hazy":"kabur","Conditions":"Kondisi","%d° now with %@ conditions. There is a precipitation chance of %@. Wind from %@ with gusts up to %d %@. Today's temperature ranges from %d° to %d° and feels like %d°. %@, and %@.":"%d° sekarang dengan kondisi %@. Ada kemungkinan presipitasi sebesar %@. Angin dari %@ dengan hembusan hingga %d %@. Suhu hari ini berkisar antara %d° hingga %d° dan terasa seperti %d°. %@, dan %@.","Daily Summary":"Ringkasan Harian","The daily chance of precipitation tends to be higher than the chance for each hour.":"Peluang terjadinya curah hujan harian cenderung lebih tinggi dibandingkan peluang setiap jamnya.","The dew point is %d° to %d°.":"Titik embun adalah %d° hingga %d°.","The dew point will be %d° to %d°.":"Titik embunnya adalah %d° hingga %d°.","Feels Like conveys how warm or cold it feels and can be different from the actual temperature. The Feels Like temperature is affected by humidity, sunlight and wind.":"Suhu yang terasa menunjukkan seberapa hangat atau dingin udara dirasakan dan dapat berbeda dari suhu sebenarnya. Nilainya dipengaruhi oleh kelembapan, sinar matahari, dan angin.","On %@, the average humidity will be %d%%.\n%@":"Pada %@, kelembapan rata-rata adalah %d%%.\n%@","Today, the average humidity is %d%%. %@":"Saat ini, kelembapan rata-rata adalah %d%%. %@","On %@, the total precipitation will be %.1f%@.":"Pada %@, total curah hujan adalah %.1f%@.","On %@, the lowest visibility will be %@ at %d %@, and the highest will be %@ at %d %@.":"Pada %@, visibilitas terendah adalah %@ di %d %@, dan visibilitas tertinggi adalah %@ di %d %@.","Today, the visibility will be %@, at %d to %d %@.":"Hari ini, jarak pandangnya adalah %@, pada %d hingga %d %@.","H: %d°":"Tertinggi: %d°","Humidity around %d%%":"Kelembapan sekitar %d%%","Humidity Avg %d%%":"Rata-rata Kelembapan %d%%","Humidity %d%%":"Kelembapan %d%%","Today's min %d%% – max %d%%":"Min hari ini %d%% – maks %d%%","LAST 24 HOURS":"24 JAM TERAKHIR","L: %d°":"Terendah: %d°","NEXT 24 HOURS":"24 JAM BERIKUTNYA","No hourly data available for this day.":"Tidak ada data per jam yang tersedia untuk hari ini.","%@'s low is %d° and the high is %d°. The temperature will feel like %d° to %d°. Wind from %@ is expected. %@":"Titik terendah %@ adalah %d° dan titik tertinggi adalah %d°. Suhu akan terasa seperti %d° hingga %d°. Angin diperkirakan berasal dari %@. %@","Hourly bars for rain & snow (%@).":"Bar setiap jam untuk hujan & salju (%@).","Heavy":"Berat","Precipitation: 0%@":"Curah hujan: 0%@","Rain: %.1f%@":"Hujan: %.1f%@","Rain: %.1f%@, Snow: %.1f%@":"Hujan: %.1f%@, Salju: %.1f%@","Precipitation Totals":"Total Curah Hujan","On %@, the average pressure will be %@ %@, and the lowest pressure will be %@ %@.":"Pada %@, tekanan rata-rata adalah %@ %@, dan tekanan terendah adalah %@ %@.","Pressure Average %@ %@":"Rata-rata Tekanan %@ %@","Pressure %@ %@":"Tekanan %@ %@","Daily range: %@–%@ %@":"Kisaran harian: %@–%@ %@","Rain":"Hujan","Snow":"Salju","The Beaufort wind scale expresses how forceful or strong the wind is at a given speed. The Beaufort scale may make it easier to understand how windy it will feel or how much effect the wind could have. Each value on the scale corresponds to a wind speed range.":"Skala angin Beaufort menunjukkan seberapa kuat atau kuatnya angin pada kecepatan tertentu. Skala Beaufort mungkin memudahkan untuk memahami seberapa berangin atau seberapa besar pengaruh angin. Setiap nilai pada skala sesuai dengan rentang kecepatan angin.","The actual air temperature.":"Suhu udara sebenarnya.","The wind speed is calculated using the average over a short period of time. Gusts are short bursts of wind above this average. A gust typically lasts under 20 seconds.":"Kecepatan angin dihitung menggunakan rata-rata dalam periode waktu singkat. Hembusan adalah hembusan angin pendek di atas rata-rata. Hembusan angin biasanya berlangsung kurang dari 20 detik.","Today's chance: %d%%":"Peluang hari ini: %d%%","Total":"Jumlah","No moderate or higher UV levels are expected for this day.":"Diperkirakan tidak ada tingkat UV sedang atau lebih tinggi pada hari ini.","Sun protection recommended. UV levels range from %@ to %@, reached between %@ and %@.":"Perlindungan matahari direkomendasikan. Tingkat UV berkisar dari %@ hingga %@, mencapai antara %@ dan %@.","Today's %@ %d":"%@ %d hari ini","UV index up to %d":"Indeks UV hingga %d","Visibility %d %@":"Visibilitas %d %@","min %d – max %d %@":"min %d – maks %d %@","What the temperature feels like as a result of humidity, sunlight or wind.":"Bagaimana rasanya suhu akibat kelembapan, sinar matahari, atau angin.","Gusts up to %d":"Hembusan angin hingga %d","Wind Speed %d":"Kecepatan Angin %d","Wind Speed %d-%d":"Kecepatan Angin %d-%d","Wind is currently %1$d %2$@ from the %3$@. Today, wind speeds are %4$d to %5$d %2$@, with gusts up to %6$d %2$@.":"Angin saat ini %1$d %2$@ dari %3$@. Saat ini, kecepatan angin adalah %4$d hingga %5$d %2$@, dengan hembusan angin hingga %6$d %2$@.","Wind speeds range from %1$d to %2$d %3$@, with gusts up to %4$d %3$@.":"Kecepatan angin berkisar dari %1$d hingga %2$d %3$@, dengan hembusan hingga %4$d %3$@.","Weather views":"Pemandangan cuaca","Max S":"Kecepatan maks.","Max G":"Hembusan maks.","Illumination":"Pencahayaan","10-DAY FORECAST":"PRAKIRAAN 10 HARI","Choose Reader, Writer, or Owner. Owners can also share this event and manage access.":"Pilih Pembaca, Editor, atau Pemilik. Pemilik juga dapat membagikan acara ini dan mengelola akses.","People with this event":"Orang dengan acara ini","People with this calendar":"Orang dengan akses ke kalender ini","Not signed in":"Belum masuk","Original creator":"Pencipta asli","Invitation pending":"Undangan tertunda","Cloud Calendars user":"Pengguna Kalender Awan","Resend":"Kirim ulang","Remove Access":"Hapus akses","Remove Access?":"Hapus akses?","People appear here after they add the 